{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁーたｚｅｅｐって書いちゃったみたい だだーごめんなさいいーっ＿|￣|○！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、乃木どこ収録でしたーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/18/0052422/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん、とってもとっても楽しかったーーー(#^.^#)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり乃木メン大好きだな。。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/18/0052422/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にっこり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/18/0052422/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいここで突然の北海道での写真どんっ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんね今日撮り忘れたんよ ( ◞˟૩˟)◞  しょんぼり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は絶対撮るうーから待っとけいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、最近のあみあみですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1日お水2リットル飲むこと心がけてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃ大変だけど、健康にいいらしいのね(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條の水の飲まなさはんぱじゃなくて、ときたま脱水症状もどきになりかけるから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近たくさん飲むように頑張ろうと試みてるです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/18/0052422/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなもお水たっくさん飲んどきいーーーっな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返すだっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.来月の握手会で香水つけてみよかなって思ってるねんけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみはどんな香水が好き？オススメ教えてください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.えーとあみは、ブルガリのブラックとか、あとはサムライも好きっ(#^.^#)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにあみは、トミーガールとエンジェルハートを使いまわししてる(#^.^#)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.何の食べ物が好きなの(*^o^*)返事よろしくね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.カニでしょ！？あとは、アボカド！生クリーム！へいっ！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.市場で売られてる魚は怒ってるの？笑ってるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.美味しく食べてあげるから笑ってるの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみの好きな言葉は何ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"できれば理由も聞きたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.一度した失敗は二度としない。好きというかいつも心にとどめてる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.乃木坂めんばーの中で、誰が１番ひめたんの取り扱いが上手いんでしょう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.んーおそらく能條でしょうね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやほんとに！！ほんとだってば！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.愛未は雷、苦手なのカナ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.雷がきてちょっとテンション上がっちゃうのってもしかしてあみだけ？？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.質問！あみあみが好きです！どうしましょ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.はーいあみあみ族加入～！ということであみの握手会に来なたい。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ、また、握手会に行きたくなって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とてつもなくなったら行ってもいいですかね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつでもおいでなさい！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にっこにこで待ってるからね(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.一番行きたい国はどこ？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ボラボラ島(#^.^#)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.あみあみって芸能人だと誰によく似てるって言われる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.高島彩さんに似てるとかたまぁーに！わたすはあんなに美しくないのだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ. 個別握手会でアドバイスをしてもいいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.おっ！アドバイスしてくれるんですか？？是非お願いしますっ！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.わたしにニックネームつけてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達からは「あみ」としか呼ばれないから変わったあだ名が欲しくてｗ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.あみスタシア！！直感でごわす。"}